From: Marco Müller <hello@annoyedmilk.ch>
Subject: [PATCH] main: count only the default parameters that are set

parse_mode_config() counted each known parameter of [BR] and [LE], also
when main.conf does not set it.  load_defaults() then found no value to
send, and logged "Failed to set default system config for hciN" at
each start, although nothing failed.

Upstream: not sent
---
--- a/src/main.c
+++ b/src/main.c
@@ -515,9 +515,8 @@
 					&val, params[i].min, params[i].max)) {
 			val = htobl(val);
 			memcpy(params[i].val, &val, params[i].size);
+			++btd_opts.defaults.num_entries;
 		}
-
-		++btd_opts.defaults.num_entries;
 	}
 }
 
